  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 103.40 Owner",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.40 “Owner” means the person who holds legal title to the real property, treatment facilities, distribution system, or other appurtenances, or any combination thereof, that comprise a public water system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
